---
description: Test fixtures and native oracles for ELF execution
globs: engine/tests/fixtures/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Do not overwrite committed fixture binaries or oracle files. Add new fixtures alongside with: source, binary, `.stdout`,
  `.exitcode`, `.objdump.txt`/`.readelf.txt`, and (for libc programs) `.strace.txt`, plus a recipe in `regenerate.sh`.
- Oracles come from running the real binary natively; the engine result must match stdout and exit code exactly.
- Current fixtures: `elf_write_exit` (hand assembly, exit 37), `sum_squares` (freestanding gcc -O2, `sum=338350`),
  `libc_startup` (musl static hello; engine does not run it yet, see docs/STATUS.md).
